## Invariants

- Dedup is tracked against **all items ever seen** (the `seen` Set across all rounds), not just the current round's output — bound to: `test('deduplicates items seen in prior rounds')`.
- The returned array has **exactly `target` items** even when the final `findCandidates()` call adds more than needed — bound to: `test('caps at exactly target when last round overshoots')`.
